          "docs": "<p>Returns information about the last resize operation for the specified cluster. If no resize operation has ever been initiated for the specified cluster, a <code>HTTP 404</code> error is returned. If a resize operation was initiated and completed, the status of the resize remains as <code>SUCCEEDED</code> until the next resize. </p> <p>A resize operation can be requested using <a>ModifyCluster</a> and specifying a different number or type of nodes for the cluster. </p>"
